[gd_resource type="ShaderMaterial" load_steps=2 format=3]

; M_EmissiveTeal — the system's own colour, running through every recessed
; channel in the kit. Packets move at 1.9 m/s with 2.6 m spacing: slow enough to
; read as data rather than as a Christmas light, fast enough that a stationary
; player can see it move.
;
; Energy 3.4 sits just above the environment's glow HDR threshold of 1.35, so
; these bloom and nothing else in the scene does. That is the whole reason the
; threshold is where it is.


